%YAML 1.1
%TAG !u! tag:unity3d.com,2011:
--- !u!114 &11400000
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: e9620f8c34305754d8cc9a7e49e852d9, type: 3}
  m_Name: GameStrings_en
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Unity.Localization::UnityEngine.Localization.Tables.StringTable
  m_LocaleId:
    m_Code: en
  m_SharedData: {fileID: 11400000, guid: a280628737193b24f9e44f409150a145, type: 2}
  m_Metadata:
    m_Items:
    - rid: 7338888474672496640
  m_TableData:
  - m_Id: 40920301974368257
    m_Localized: Syndrath the Devourer circles the Heart. The sky itself has turned
      against us. Keep your eyes up, Keeper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368256
    m_Localized: The walls hold a force-field of the Heart's own light - see it shimmer
      in the gates. It turns the Hollowed back while it shines. But every blow thins
      it, and a thinned field lets the dark slip through. Keep the walls and gates
      mended, and the light keeps its strength.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1076879361
    m_Localized: In an old valley, an old tree.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1076879362
    m_Localized: In the dark beyond, a slow cold rot.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1076879363
    m_Localized: You are the Keeper. The song is yours now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1076879364
    m_Localized: Welcome home, Keeper. The Heart hums for you. Walk a while - the
      song will tell you what it needs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1076879365
    m_Localized: This is Elarion. Touch the dais. The crystal will remember you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1076879366
    m_Localized: The Heart gives what it can spare. Hold these - you will need them.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1076879367
    m_Localized: The Folk built these long before you. Each one tends to the Heart
      in its own way.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1076879368
    m_Localized: What you cannot grow here, the wanderers bring. Spend wisely. Coins
      are slow to earn.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073664
    m_Localized: The dark has noticed us. Place your companions at the slots. They
      will know what to do.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073665
    m_Localized: A spirit at a slot defends. A spirit at a building tends. They cannot
      do both at once.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073666
    m_Localized: This is your magic, but it is the Heart's gift. Use what is given.
      It returns when it can.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073667
    m_Localized: For when a lane fails. The cold buys you a breath. Use the breath
      well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073668
    m_Localized: Plant light where the dark gathers thickest. The towers within will
      fight braver.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073669
    m_Localized: This is the deep magic. Spend it only when the Heart calls for it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073670
    m_Localized: Welcome home, Keeper. The spire holds the realm's last song. Protect
      it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073671
    m_Localized: The Hollowed come from the dark beyond the walls. They want to extinguish
      the Light.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073672
    m_Localized: Build your defenses with what you have. Walk to the Crystal Mine
      - tap to gather.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073673
    m_Localized: Good. Spend crystals at the Workshop to upgrade your defenses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073674
    m_Localized: When you are ready, begin a wave. Tap a skill to cast - your magic
      returns when the spire allows.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073675
    m_Localized: Your Wardens fight beside you. Tap one to give them a station.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073676
    m_Localized: The spire remembers your kindness. Tend it well, Keeper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073677
    m_Localized: The Heart's light parts for those it knows. Walk through, Keeper
      - but the Hollow Ones will press against it. Mend the gate as you mend the
      walls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073678
    m_Localized: The gate has fallen. They come through unhindered. Hold the inner
      ring and repair the field before the next dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073679
    m_Localized: The light remembers you. The gate holds again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073680
    m_Localized: They come from the cold places. They will move slowly, and bite
      hard.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073681
    m_Localized: The frost-marked are at the gates. Keep your fires lit.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073682
    m_Localized: The ember-bound come, hungry for the green things. Hold the eastern
      lanes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073683
    m_Localized: They burn as they march. Do not let them touch the Heart's roots.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073684
    m_Localized: Wisps of the unmade - quick, half-here. Aim true.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073685
    m_Localized: The half-souls drift in. They feel the Heart's pull. Turn them back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073686
    m_Localized: A many-tongued tide. Read the lanes before you place.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073687
    m_Localized: They come from every dark. Trust your Wardens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073688
    m_Localized: Alduin the Mournful walks at the head of this tide. He was a healer,
      once. Greet him with steel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073689
    m_Localized: He returns when the Withering finds purchase. Send him back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073690
    m_Localized: The song shifts. The dark is at the gates.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073691
    m_Localized: A lane wavers. The Heart felt it before you did.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073692
    m_Localized: The walls are thinning. The Heart calls for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073693
    m_Localized: The song breaks. Defend, Keeper - defend now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073694
    m_Localized: The Heart settles. The folk breathe again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073695
    m_Localized: He stands within the gate. Time slows. The light dims.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073696
    m_Localized: The song rises. The valley holds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073697
    m_Localized: The light shifts. The dark is at the gates.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073698
    m_Localized: The spire stirs. The watch begins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073699
    m_Localized: A lane wavers. The chord felt it before you did.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073700
    m_Localized: Something pushes harder than the rest. Look to it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073701
    m_Localized: The walls are thinning. Elarion calls for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073702
    m_Localized: Two lanes at once. Keep your hands moving.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073703
    m_Localized: The chord breaks. Defend, Keeper - defend now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073704
    m_Localized: The spire shudders. Hold the line at all costs.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073705
    m_Localized: He stands within the gate. Time slows. The light dims.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073706
    m_Localized: Alduin the Mournful walks the lane. Greet him with steel.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073707
    m_Localized: The light returns. The village breathes again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073708
    m_Localized: The song rises. Elarion holds.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073709
    m_Localized: The crystal flickers. The Heart has taken its first blow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073710
    m_Localized: Leaves fall in the wrong season. The song has gone thin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073711
    m_Localized: The bark is cracking. Hold, Keeper. Hold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073712
    m_Localized: The song is almost gone. Spend everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073713
    m_Localized: ...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073714
    m_Localized: The flame flickers. The Lantern has taken its first blow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073715
    m_Localized: Leaves fall in the wrong season. The warmth has gone thin.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073716
    m_Localized: The bark is splitting. Hold, Guardian. Hold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073717
    m_Localized: The light is almost out. Spend everything.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073718
    m_Localized: They fall back. The Heart steadies. A breath, then the next.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073719
    m_Localized: The dark withdraws. Tend your companions. The song is not yet done.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073720
    m_Localized: The lanes hold. The folk light a candle for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073721
    m_Localized: Alduin breaks apart at the Heart's threshold. The Withering crawls
      home.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073722
    m_Localized: The valley sings. The folk weep. You are still the Keeper. The work
      begins again tomorrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073723
    m_Localized: None before you held so long. The old Keepers would have nodded.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073724
    m_Localized: The dark withdraws - for now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073725
    m_Localized: The chord holds. The watch breathes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073726
    m_Localized: The Folk light a candle for you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073727
    m_Localized: The lanes are quiet again. Tend your Wardens.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073728
    m_Localized: A breath. A moment. The next tide will come.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073729
    m_Localized: The wind cools. Elarion remembers your name.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073730
    m_Localized: The song stops. The folk look up. The wind feels cold for the first
      time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073731
    m_Localized: The Heart breaks. But the bond does not. Begin again, Keeper - there
      is no other answer.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073732
    m_Localized: Elarion will return where it is needed. You will too.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073733
    m_Localized: The light stops. The folk look up. The wind feels cold for the first
      time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073734
    m_Localized: The chord falters. But the bond does not. Begin again, Keeper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073735
    m_Localized: (a soft musical hum)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073736
    m_Localized: (a warm yip, like a small bell)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073737
    m_Localized: (a low, considered breath)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073738
    m_Localized: (a long, surprised note)
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073739
    m_Localized: The Sprite watches you as you work. You do not know what it sees.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073740
    m_Localized: It hums a single note, then forgets it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073741
    m_Localized: It glows brighter when you smile. You did not know that yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073742
    m_Localized: The Pup is dreaming of fire again. Its tail twitches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073743
    m_Localized: It curled up on the warm stones at sunset. It has not moved since.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073744
    m_Localized: It bared its teeth at a draft. The draft retreated.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073745
    m_Localized: Aldwin came back from the orchard with ice on his muzzle. You did
      not ask.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073746
    m_Localized: Aldwin pads silently. When the Hollowed come, he bares his teeth
      and does not look away.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073747
    m_Localized: His breath does not cloud. You wonder if he is breathing at all.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073748
    m_Localized: The Pup is dreaming of fire again. Its tail twitches.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073749
    m_Localized: The Mine is full. The Folk left a candle by the door this morning.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073750
    m_Localized: There is a song in the wood, faint and old. The Heart is humming.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073751
    m_Localized: The Sprite watches me as I work. I do not know what it sees.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073752
    m_Localized: The Folk leave bread in the workshop when they do not see me. I
      find it. I do not thank them yet.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073753
    m_Localized: Aldwin came back from the orchard with a scrap of ice on his muzzle.
      I asked. He did not say.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073754
    m_Localized: The Tower's lamp has been lit for ten thousand mornings. It is my
      turn to keep it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073755
    m_Localized: I think the Heart sang me to sleep last night. I cannot tell anymore
      where its voice ends and mine begins.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073756
    m_Localized: The Sprite glows brighter. Something it could not do yesterday,
      it can do today.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073757
    m_Localized: A new shape in the song. The Heart taught it while you slept.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073758
    m_Localized: Alduin falls. The folk will sing about this evening for a hundred
      years.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073759
    m_Localized: The wanderer bows. The folk will know your name in three valleys.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073760
    m_Localized: The Workshop bell is louder now. The Folk are pleased.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073761
    m_Localized: Seven mornings tending the song. The old Keepers would have called
      you 'one of ours' by now.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073762
    m_Localized: Elarion kept your hearth warm. Welcome back, Keeper.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073763
    m_Localized: Aether. The Heart's own light, shared and reshared. Mends what the
      dark has frayed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073764
    m_Localized: Flame. The hearth's old defiance. Burns what would creep into the
      warm places.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073765
    m_Localized: Ice. The patient cold that holds the dark still until the song catches
      up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073766
    m_Localized: Crystals. The Heart's slow gift. Mined where its overflow seeps
      up through the stone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301970173953
    m_Localized: Tend the Lantern. Hold the dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073768
    m_Localized: Coins. Quiet currency, brought by the wanderers from valleys still
      standing. Spend them on what cannot be grown here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073769
    m_Localized: Where the Heart's gem-sap seeps into stone. Pets here tend the seam.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073770
    m_Localized: An ancient recess in the world tree's roots. The echoes rest here
      between battles, their presence a low hum in the stones.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073771
    m_Localized: Built by the first Keepers. Holds the ward-stones that answer your
      call.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073772
    m_Localized: Wheat that grows because the Heart wills it. Apples taste like the
      old summers.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073773
    m_Localized: Hammer and forge. The Folk make what the Keeper needs and ask nothing.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073774
    m_Localized: Crystals
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073775
    m_Localized: The Heart's slow gift. Mined where its overflow seeps up through
      the stone.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301970173952
    m_Localized: Tend the Heart. Hold the dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301924036608
    m_Localized: Hold the Chord. Defend the Spire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073778
    m_Localized: Coins
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073779
    m_Localized: Quiet currency, brought by the wanderers from valleys still standing.
      Spend it on what cannot be grown here.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073780
    m_Localized: Voidshards
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073781
    m_Localized: Splinters of the Withering, left where a great Hollow One fell.
      The ward-stones drink them and grow strong.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073782
    m_Localized: Stone
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073783
    m_Localized: Drawn from the valley's old bones. The walls remember the shape
      of it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073784
    m_Localized: Iron
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073785
    m_Localized: Cold metal from the deep seams. The Folk forge it into walls the
      dark cannot easily pass.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073786
    m_Localized: Wood
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073787
    m_Localized: Fallen timber from the green places the Heart still keeps. It braces
      the highest walls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073788
    m_Localized: The Walls
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073789
    m_Localized: Raise the perimeter the Folk built around the Heart. Stone, iron
      and wood mend it higher.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073790
    m_Localized: The Towers
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073791
    m_Localized: Stone spires raised by the first Keepers. Their ward-stones answer
      your call against the dark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073792
    m_Localized: Build
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073793
    m_Localized: Touch a marked ground to raise a spire, or the wall to mend it higher.
      The Folk do the rest.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073794
    m_Localized: The Keeper's Ledger
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073795
    m_Localized: Hear the old story again, keep a copy of your watch, or begin a
      new one.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073796
    m_Localized: The Old Lessons
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073797
    m_Localized: How to keep the watch - what the previous Keepers would have told
      you.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073798
    m_Localized: The Other Valleys
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073799
    m_Localized: Join your watch to other Keepers, tend the roster, and trade word
      across the realm.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073800
    m_Localized: The Mailbox
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073801
    m_Localized: Notes carried in by the wanderers. Send your own word with your
      invite mark.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073802
    m_Localized: Your Hall
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073803
    m_Localized: All you have gathered - every spirit bonded, every place raised.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073804
    m_Localized: The Dark Stirs
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073805
    m_Localized: A tide gathers beyond the walls. Gather what you can and ready your
      defenses.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073806
    m_Localized: Call the Wave
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073807
    m_Localized: Do not wait for the dark. Meet it now, on your own watch.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073808
    m_Localized: Arcane Bolt
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073809
    m_Localized: Your magic, but it is the Heart's gift. Use what is given - it returns
      when it can.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073810
    m_Localized: Frost Nova
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073811
    m_Localized: For when a lane fails. The cold buys you a breath. Use the breath
      well.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073812
    m_Localized: Healing Beacon
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073813
    m_Localized: Plant light where the dark gathers thickest. The Heart and all who
      stand near mend in it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073814
    m_Localized: Meteor Strike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073815
    m_Localized: This is the deep magic. Spend it only when the Heart calls for it.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073816
    m_Localized: Sword Strike
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073817
    m_Localized: Plain steel, close and sure. It asks nothing of the Heart and is
      always ready.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073818
    m_Localized: Shield Bash
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073819
    m_Localized: Set your shield against the tide. The Hollow Ones falter, and you
      keep the line.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073820
    m_Localized: Banner of Valor
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073821
    m_Localized: Raise the old colors. A whole rank of the dark is cut down where
      it stands.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073822
    m_Localized: Vow of Iron
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073823
    m_Localized: A promise kept to the Heart. Its light floods back into the wound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073824
    m_Localized: Quick Shot
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073825
    m_Localized: A clean arrow loosed long. It costs nothing and the string is never
      still for long.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073826
    m_Localized: Snare Arrow
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073827
    m_Localized: Pin a Hollow One to the ground. It will not reach the Heart's roots
      tonight.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073828
    m_Localized: Hawk's Eye
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073829
    m_Localized: Aim true and far. One shot carries the weight of the dark you turn
      back.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073830
    m_Localized: Volley
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073831
    m_Localized: Loose every arrow to the sky at once. They come down like a hard
      rain on the tide.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073832
    m_Localized: Drag the joystick in the bottom-left corner to walk around the village.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073833
    m_Localized: Tap anywhere on the ground and your hero will walk there.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073834
    m_Localized: Drag the joystick to move - or tap the ground to walk somewhere.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073835
    m_Localized: The realm beyond Elarion stirs. Visit the Wayshrine - the pale standing
      stone - to set out across the Realm Map.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073836
    m_Localized: My lord - ENEMIES! The shop can wait!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073837
    m_Localized: Goods later, glory now! To arms!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073838
    m_Localized: You want to shop? NOW?! Help us, please!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073839
    m_Localized: Coin won't save us from this lot - your magic will!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073840
    m_Localized: My lord, the till is barricaded! Get to the Heart!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1081073841
    m_Localized: Discounts after the wave, I swear it! Fight!
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368258
    m_Localized: A black wing crosses the sun. The Devourer hunts where the realm
      is weakest - do not let it find the Heart wanting.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368259
    m_Localized: Defenders of the Realm
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368260
    m_Localized: powered by SKR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368261
    m_Localized: Take Up the Watch
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368262
    m_Localized: Dive into Village
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368263
    m_Localized: Jump into the Action
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368264
    m_Localized: Thrain
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368265
    m_Localized: Frostweaver
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368266
    m_Localized: An elder scholar of the crystal seams, his staff sings the cold
      awake. Where Thrain walks, the dark slows and the frost remembers every name
      it freezes.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368267
    m_Localized: Grom
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368268
    m_Localized: Lightbearer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368269
    m_Localized: Hammer in hand and the sun's emblem on his shield, Grom carries
      blessed steel into the breach. Where his light falls, the Hollowed falter and
      the walls hold.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368270
    m_Localized: Sylas
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368271
    m_Localized: Wood Warden
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368272
    m_Localized: An elf of the green lanes who looses a clean arrow on the wind long
      before the dark draws near. Sylas reads the wood, snares the swift, and turns
      a tide arrow by arrow.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368273
    m_Localized: Elara
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368274
    m_Localized: Divine Healer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368275
    m_Localized: A vessel of the Heart's own light, Elara mends the wounded and wraps
      the faithful in holy ward. The dark cannot outlast a grace that rises faster
      than it can wound.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368276
    m_Localized: Choose Your First Warden
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368277
    m_Localized: A spirit will walk the watch beside you. Bond with one - it will
      know your kindness, and your battles.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368278
    m_Localized: Bond With This Warden
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368279
    m_Localized: The sawmill's blade hums against timber the green places of Elarion
      still spare. Its planks brace the highest walls.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368280
    m_Localized: The armorer's fire never cools. Here the Folk beat raw iron into
      plate the Hollowed cannot easily bite through.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368281
    m_Localized: Swap to SKR
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368282
    m_Localized: You send
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368283
    m_Localized: You receive
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368284
    m_Localized: Exchange rate
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368285
    m_Localized: Service fee
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368286
    m_Localized: Network fee
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368287
    m_Localized: Swap Now
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368288
    m_Localized: Powered by Jupiter Aggregator
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368289
    m_Localized: Enter an amount to see the rate.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368290
    m_Localized: Getting rate...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368291
    m_Localized: Connect your wallet to swap.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368292
    m_Localized: Sending to wallet for approval...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368293
    m_Localized: Could not fetch rate. Check connection.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368294
    m_Localized: Swap failed. Please try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368295
    m_Localized: Tell Us Honestly
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368296
    m_Localized: Tell us what works, what does not, and what is missing. We read
      every response, and the thank-you is the same whatever you write.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368297
    m_Localized: What is working, and what is not?
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368298
    m_Localized: Send And Claim
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368299
    m_Localized: 'One time only: 1000 wood, 1000 stone and 1000 iron, delivered in
      full.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368300
    m_Localized: Rate Us On The Store
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368301
    m_Localized: Separate, and nothing is rewarded for it - no store tells us whether
      you did.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368302
    m_Localized: Feedback
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368303
    m_Localized: Send Feedback
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368304
    m_Localized: Sending...
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368305
    m_Localized: We could not reach the feedback service just now. Please try again
      later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368306
    m_Localized: The store link is not configured on this build.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368307
    m_Localized: Thank you - your words are with us. 1000 wood, 1000 stone and 1000
      iron have been added to your stores, in full.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368308
    m_Localized: Thank you - your words are with us. The thank-you was already claimed
      on this realm, so nothing was added this time.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368309
    m_Localized: Thank you - your words are with us. The thank-you could not be added
      right now; it is still owed to you and has not been used up.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301974368310
    m_Localized: A few more words, please - at least {Minimum} characters.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7338888474672496640
  - m_Id: 40920301978562560
    m_Localized: We could not verify your account, so nothing was sent. Try again
      later.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301978562561
    m_Localized: The server did not accept that. Nothing was sent - please try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301978562562
    m_Localized: We could not reach the server. Your words were not sent; please
      try again.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301978562563
    m_Localized: Your {Resource} is now {AmountOver} above what your stores can hold.
      All of it is yours and stays yours; harvests and rewards into {Resource} simply
      pause until you spend back under.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7338888474672496640
  - m_Id: 40920301978562564
    m_Localized: JEWELER UNLOCKED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301978562565
    m_Localized: 'A rare item was recovered.

      Sable can polish it into a refined
      gem.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301978562566
    m_Localized: Open Jeweler
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301978562567
    m_Localized: Take it to Sable at the Jeweler.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301978562568
    m_Localized: Checking the logged-in wallet for an active native SKR stake.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301978562569
    m_Localized: 'Native SKR stake verified: +1 weekly re-roll added.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301978562570
    m_Localized: 'Native SKR stake verified: +1 weekly re-roll added. Your 10,000+
      SKR stake also raises the per-stone roll cap to 6.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301978562571
    m_Localized: 'Native SKR stake not verified: no weekly re-roll was added.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301978562572
    m_Localized: POLISH THE STONE
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301978562573
    m_Localized: Sable needs {Duration} to polish the stone. When the work is complete,
      the gem inside will be revealed.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7338888474672496640
  - m_Id: 40920301978562574
    m_Localized: Begin Polish - {Duration}
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7338888474672496640
  - m_Id: 40920301978562575
    m_Localized: Sable has begun polishing. Follow it in the Work Queue.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301978562576
    m_Localized: The stone could not be placed on the bench.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301978562577
    m_Localized: There is no rough stone in your larder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301978562578
    m_Localized: GEM REVEALED
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 40920301978562579
    m_Localized: Sable reveals a {Gem}. It has been added to your larder.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items:
      - rid: 7338888474672496640
  - m_Id: 40920301978562580
    m_Localized: Keep Gem
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
